                <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5__qstr-1__subsec-2">
                  <num>2</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>If regulations prescribe an industry code, the industry code may prescribe pecuniary penalties not exceeding <quantity refersTo="#penaltyUnit">300 penalty units</quantity> for civil penalty provisions of the industry code.</p>
                  </content>
                </subsection>
              </quotedStructure>
